  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://github.com/gordcurrie/waypoint/sync/schemas/training_status.schema.json",
  "title": "Training status (get_training_status)",
  "description": "Returned by garminconnect's get_training_status(date). Consumed by sync_training_status. Device-keyed nesting confirmed live: mostRecentTrainingStatus.latestTrainingStatusData is keyed by deviceId (string), not a flat dict \u2014 code must iterate .values() and pick the entry with primaryTrainingDevice=true.\n\nVerified against: 2026-07-24. Additional fields beyond what's listed here may exist and are tolerated (additionalProperties: true) \u2014 Garmin adding new fields is not a breaking change; a listed field disappearing or changing type is."
